## Security Hardening
- [x] C1: JWT_SECRET gate para staging/production
- [x] SEC-01: Remove hardcoded JWT default, require JWT_SECRET always
- [x] C5: IPFS key — Date.now() → crypto.getRandomValues()
- [x] C6: CORS wildcard → http://localhost:3000
- [x] H4: Pipeline timer handle cleanup
- [x] H5: secureHashPassword → hashData (renombrado)
- [x] H7: jti claim en JWT tokens
- [x] H9: IPFS download() ahora descifra realmente
- [x] H2/H3: User scoping — vault/credential owner isolation

## Resilience
- [x] Retry/Backoff utility (exponential + jitter)
- [x] IPFS retry (upload/download, maxAttempts 3)
- [x] Postgres retry (reads: 2, writes: 3)
- [x] Connection pooling (pg.Pool, max 10, idle 30s)
- [x] Health checks (DB + IPFS dependency verification)
- [x] Ready check (all deps must be reachable)
- [x] API request timeout (30s → 504)
- [x] Structured logging (logger.ts, JSON/human formats)

