## Chrome Extension Manifest V3 Fixes (2026-09-22)
- [x] Fix `process.env` errors — added `buildDefines` with `LOG_LEVEL`/`LOG_FORMAT` replacement
- [x] Fix ESM/CJS mismatch — changed options format from `"esm"` to `"iife"`
- [x] Fix ERR_HTTP_HEADERS_SENT — serialize BEFORE `writeHead`, add `!res.headersSent` guards
